@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EAF0FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #1749B5
left to right direction
title Privacidad: coordinación de purga entre bounded contexts
component "Sharing & Retention" as sharing
component "Practice Session\nManagement" as sessions
component "Scoring & Feedback" as scoring
component "Progress & Adaptation" as progress
component "Gamification" as game
component "Notifications" as notifications
sharing --> sessions : Elimina evidencia y sesión\nCustomer/Supplier + PL
sharing --> scoring : Elimina evaluación\nCustomer/Supplier + PL
sharing --> progress : Retira métricas y recalcula resumen\nCustomer/Supplier + PL
sharing --> game : Recalcula rachas y logros\nCustomer/Supplier + PL
sessions ..> sharing : Confirma purga
scoring ..> sharing : Confirma purga
progress ..> sharing : Confirma purga
game ..> sharing : Confirma actualización
sharing --> notifications : Acceso Revocado / Datos Purgados\nPublished Language
legend bottom
Diseño propuesto de contratos asíncronos y confirmaciones por eventos.
Cada contexto elimina sus datos; Sharing controla acceso y seguimiento.
Speech Analysis procesa métricas sin conservar una base de reportes propia.
endlegend
@enduml
